        <div>
          <h2>More than one concern?</h2>
          <p class="lede">Conditions often happen together, such as depression and anxiety, or mental health and substance use. You don’t have to treat them one at a time with separate providers: one Hopewell team treats them together, with one plan. Learn how we treat <a class="inl" href="/what-we-treat/co-occurring/">co-occurring disorders</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

