        <div class="sec-head"><h2>How we treat: therapy first, medication second</h2><p class="lede">Our board-certified specialists take a multidisciplinary approach. Most plans combine therapy, skills and, when it helps, medication, coordinated by one team across our <a class="inl" href="/treatment-methods/">treatment methods</a>.</p></div>
