      <div class="container hb-split">
        <div class="hb-photo">
          <img src={P + "tx-east-hampton-play-room.webp"} alt="A testing and therapy room at Hopewell's East Hampton office" width="1200" height="900" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2>Getting to the root, with testing and evaluation</h2>
          <p class="lede" style="margin-top:14px">An accurate picture is where good treatment begins. When symptoms overlap, or past treatment hasn’t helped, testing gives you and your clinicians a clear place to start.</p>
          <ul class="hb-check">
            <li><span class="sv-tick"><Icon name="check" class="h-4 w-4" /></span><span><a class="inl" href="/treatment-methods/neuropsychological-testing/">Neuropsychological testing</a> of attention, memory and learning</span></li>
