            <h2>Not sure what you’re dealing with?</h2>
            <p>You don’t need a diagnosis to reach out. Many people call us knowing only that something isn’t right: they can’t sleep, they’re snapping at the people they love, or the things that used to work have stopped working. That’s okay.</p>
            <p>Tell us what’s going on. Our team will listen, check your insurance for free, and help you find the right starting point, whether that’s <a class="inl" href="/programs/counseling/">counseling</a>, an evaluation, or an <a class="inl" href="/programs/intensive-outpatient-program/">intensive program</a>. See <a class="inl" href="/admissions/">how admissions works</a>.</p>
            <div class="hb-unsure-ctas"><a href="tel:8607351448" class="btn btn-blue"><Icon name="phone" />Call (860) 735-1448</a><a href="#verify" class="btn btn-ghost only-d">Verify my insurance</a><a href="#verify-m" class="btn btn-ghost only-m">Verify my insurance</a></div>
